    "stdout": "T011 : ∀ (n : ℕ) (E : Set (GPEucl n)),\n  ((∀ (k : ℕ) (x : GPEucl k) (t : ℝ), GPhead (GPappend x t) = x ∧ (GPappend x t).ofLp (Fin.last k) = t) ∧\n      (∀ (k : ℕ) (z : GPEucl (k + 1)), GPappend (GPhead z) (z.ofLp (Fin.last k)) = z) ∧\n        (∀ (k : ℕ) (x y : GPEucl k) (t u : ℝ), dist (GPappend x t) (GPappend y u) = √(dist x y ^ 2 + |t - u| ^ 2)) ∧\n          ∀ (k : ℕ) (z w : GPEucl (k + 1)),\n            dist (GPhead z) (GPhead w) ≤ dist z w ∧ |z.ofLp (Fin.last k) - w.ofLp (Fin.last k)| ≤ dist z w) →\n    (∀ (B : Set ℝ) (ρ η : ℝ),\n        B.Nonempty →\n          0 ≤ ρ →\n            (∀ b ∈ B, ∀ b' ∈ B, |b - b'| ≤ ρ) →\n              0 < η →\n                BddAbove B ∧\n                  BddBelow B ∧\n                    IsLUB B (sSup B) ∧\n                      IsGLB B (sInf B) ∧\n                        sSup B - sInf B ≤ ρ ∧\n                          B ⊆ Set.Ioo (sInf B - η / 2) (sSup B + η / 2) ∧\n                            sInf B - η / 2 < sSup B + η / 2 ∧ sSup B + η / 2 - (sInf B - η / 2) ≤ ρ + η) →\n      ∀ (s δ ε : ℝ) (V : ℕ → Set (GPEucl (n + 1))),\n        0 < s →\n          0 < δ →\n            0 < ε →\n              GPcover (GPproduct E) δ V →\n                (∀ (i : ℕ), Metric.ediam (GPhead '' V i) ≤ Metric.ediam (V i)) ∧\n                  ∃ a b,\n                    ∀ (i : ℕ),\n                      (V i).Nonempty →\n                        a i < b i ∧\n                          (∀ z ∈ V i, z.ofLp (Fin.last n) ∈ Set.Ioo (a i) (b i)) ∧\n                            b i - a i ≤\n                              (Metric.ediam (V i)).toReal + ε * 2 ^ (-↑i - 1) / (1 + (Metric.ediam (V i)).toReal ^ s)\n'Translation.T011' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n",
